- **N48 — medium blocker:** [closeout_adr_associations.go:50](/var/tmp/pose-work-go/pose-review-run-3967574839/worktree/pose-mcp/internal/pose/closeout_adr_associations.go:50) silently drops encoded Markdown associations. For example, `../adr/decision%2Emd` and `../adr/decision&#46;md` name `decision.md`, but produce neither an association nor a diagnostic. Equivalent backlinks fail too. A two-member roadmap can consequently receive an incorrect exemption.
