Both prior findings are fixed. Targeted tests across domain, CLI and MCP passed; `go vet ./...` passed. Required artifact and surface commands exited 0. The repository remains unchanged.

Rules applied: mixed Go/governance feature; review workflow, backend-go, security, documentation-style, delivery-evidence and knowledge-governance.

